      "text": "Fixes the verifier FAIL on 0224ec2 (a command interrupted by a steer showed as failed; ui/src/protocol.ts now treats only a non-steered user message as a turn boundary; steer-a-running-turn checks for no failed). Real Claude (Haiku) through yardd was run on 8b3037b (same delivery path); not re-run on this head. This head is 188919d merged with main (ec9c573: #4, #10); the only hand-resolved code conflict is App::emit, which keeps main's under-lock broadcast and adds the queue's step/steer delivery. Base proofs (1215065/854707d) kept with --force across the merge; #4 and #10 do not change the queue."
